{"type":"text","timestamp":1789170740812,"sessionID":"ses_f6d1e4bfaffePKuDeJBVEyIMD6","part":{"id":"prt_092e2deaf0016HV6brNLbX6viv","messageID":"msg_092e2d828001KLaR2T0dm3sEZJ","sessionID":"ses_f6d1e4bfaffePKuDeJBVEyIMD6","type":"text","text":"Fixed in `src/search/controller.ts` with a small, internal request counter.\n\n- Only the latest search can update results, errors, or loading state.\n- Clearing the query immediately resets state and invalidates pending requests, preventing late completions from repopulating results or displaying errors.\n- Public API and normal search behavior remain unchanged.\n\nVerification:\n- `npm test`: all 4 existing tests passed.\n- Six additional in-memory race checks passed, covering stale successes and failures during a newer request, after its completion, and after clearing.\n- `git diff --check`: passed.\n\nNo tests were modified and no dependencies were installed.","time":{"start":1789170736815,"end":1789170740811},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_00330306971fc12e016aa49430c0a887d1a06b2c50fe15c035","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
